97
00:06:16.334 --> 00:06:17.502
<i>Ano ang hinahanap mo?</i>

98
00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:21.255
<i>Tapos na,
dahil patay na ang nanghihimasok, di ba?</i>

99
00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:29.722
pumasok ka

100
00:06:34.769 --> 00:06:37.355
Dala ito mula kay To To Hee kaninang hapon.

101
00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:41.192
WAIVER NG MANA

102
00:06:41.275 --> 00:06:44.695
Sa kabutihang palad, tinupad niya ang kanyang pangako.

103
00:06:44.779 --> 00:06:45.822
Pagbati, aking mahal.

104
00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:47.532
Anong pinagsasabi mo, congratulations?

105
00:06:48.116 --> 00:06:49.867
Ang lahat ay akin nang tama

106
00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:51.702
at binalik ko lang lahat.

107
00:06:52.411 --> 00:06:53.621
Syempre.

108
00:06:54.205 --> 00:06:56.457
Ang dami mo nang pinagdaanan.

109
